Modern Leadership Essentials for Emerging Leaders

Adapt, inspire and thrive in an ever-changing business environment

=20

3 & 4 September 2026

9.00am - 5.00pm | GMT +8

Concorde Hotel, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia

Zoom Video Conference

=20

Workshop Overview

The future belongs to leaders who can adapt, inspire and thrive in an ever-=
changing business environment. As organizations face evolving workforce exp=
ectations, technological advancements and increasing complexity, there is a=
 growing need to develop leaders who are prepared for tomorrow's challenges=
.

=20

This program is designed to cultivate future-ready leaders by equipping par=
ticipants with the mindset, skills and confidence to lead people, drive per=
formance, navigate change and build high-performing teams. Through interact=
ive discussions, self-assessments, case studies and practical activities, p=
articipants will strengthen their leadership capabilities and prepare thems=
elves for greater leadership responsibilities in the future.

=20

Course Outline

Session 1: Leading in a Rapidly Changing World

Session 2: Communicating for Impact

Session 3: Emotional Intelligence - the Leadership Advantage

Session 4: Problem Solving and Decision Making

Session 5: Leading High-Performance Teams

Session 6: Leading Through Difficult Conversations and Conflict

=20

Inquire/Register:

Reply with =93PDF-Leadership=94 on the email subject.

=20

=20

If you prefer not to receive any further emails, kindly reply and put =93re=
move-me=94 on the subject. Thank you.


